# MACE-MPA-0 / LAMMPS ML-IAP: LiNbOCl4 cell relaxation
clear
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
newton on
variable model string medium-mpa-0-mliap_lammps.pt
variable data string LiNbOCl4_ordered_01.data
read_data ${data}
pair_style mliap unified ${model} 0
pair_coeff * * Li Nb O Cl
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step pe ke etotal press vol lx ly lz
min_style fire
fix cell all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-8 2000 10000
unfix cell
write_data LiNbOCl4_ordered_01_mace_relaxed.data
write_dump all custom LiNbOCl4_ordered_01_mace_relaxed.dump id type x y z vx vy vz
